# This repo is authored on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and deployed to Debian.
# A shell script checked out with CRLF fails on Linux with a baffling
# "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", and a systemd unit with CRLF is parsed as
# though every value had a trailing carriage return. Pin the deployment
# artifacts to LF so the working tree cannot decide otherwise.
*.sh              text eol=lf
*.service         text eol=lf
deploy/**         text eol=lf
